      "english": "Itivuttaka"
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "This was said by the Blessed One, said by the Arahant, so I have heard: “Monks, conquered by three forms of false Dhamma–his mind overwhelmed–Devadatta is incurably doomed to deprivation, to hell, for an eon. Which three? Conquered by evil desires–his mind overwhelmed–Devadatta is incurably doomed to deprivation, to hell, for the duration of an eon. Conquered by friendship with evil people–his mind overwhelmed–Devadatta is incurably doomed to deprivation, to hell, for the duration of an eon. And, there being something further to be done, he nevertheless stopped halfway with a lower modicum of distinctive attainment. Conquered by these three forms of false Dhamma–his mind overwhelmed–Devadatta is incurably doomed to deprivation, to hell, for an eon.”"
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "May no one in the world"
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "ever be reborn"
    },
    {
      "number": 6,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "with evil desire."
    },
    {
      "number": 7,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "Know that"
    },
    {
      "number": 8,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "through that"
    },
    {
      "number": 9,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "evil desire,"
    },
    {
      "number": 10,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "his destination’s that"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "of all who have evil desires."
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "I’ve heard how Devadatta,"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "–regarded as wise, composed,"
    },
    {
      "number": 14,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "incandescent with honor–"
    },
    {
      "number": 15,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "in the thrall of heedlessness"
    },
    {
      "number": 16,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "assaulted the Tathāgata"
    },
    {
      "number": 17,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "and fell to the four-gated, fearful place:"
    },
    {
      "number": 18,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "Avīci, unmitigated hell."
    },
    {
      "number": 19,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "Whoever plots against"
    },
    {
      "number": 20,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "one free of corruption"
    },
    {
      "number": 21,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "who’s done no evil deed:"
    },
    {
      "number": 22,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "that evil touches him himself,"
    },
    {
      "number": 23,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "corrupted in mind,"
    },
    {
      "number": 24,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "disrespectful."
    },
    {
      "number": 25,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "Whoever might think"
    },
    {
      "number": 26,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "of polluting the ocean"
    },
    {
      "number": 27,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "with a pot of poison,"
    },
    {
      "number": 28,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "couldn’t succeed,"
    },
    {
      "number": 29,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "for the mass of water is great."
    },
    {
      "number": 30,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "So it is"
    },
    {
      "number": 31,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "when anyone attacks with abuse"
    },
    {
      "number": 32,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "the Tathāgata"
    },
    {
      "number": 33,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "–rightly-gone,"
    },
    {
      "number": 34,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "of peaceful mind–"
    },
    {
      "number": 35,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "for abuse doesn’t grow on him."
    },
    {
      "number": 36,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "A wise person should make friends,"
    },
    {
      "number": 37,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "should associate,"
    },
    {
      "number": 38,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "with a person like him–"
    },
    {
      "number": 39,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "whose path a monk can pursue"
    },
    {
      "number": 40,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "and reach the ending"
    },
    {
      "number": 41,
      "pali": "",
      "english": "of suffering & stress."
    }
  ]
}